<title>USA: Mellon unit sets $500 mln capital securities.</title>
<headline>Mellon unit sets $500 mln capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of capital securities, a trust preferred, from Mellon Capital Trust II was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER MELLON CAPITAL II (UNIT OF MELLON BANK CORP)</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 7.995 PCT  MATURITY 1/15/2027</p>
<p>TYPE CAPITAL SECS  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 7/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.995 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 137.5 BP   CALLABLE NON-CALL 10</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
